OL,3,GNEWSAFire damaged town hall could
OL,4,Abecome health centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe site of a town hall which was
OL,7,Fseverely damaged in a fire could be
OL,8,Fturned into a long-awaited new health
OL,9,Fcentre, an MP has said.
OL,11,FSefton MP Bill Esterson said he was
OL,12,Fbacking plans being developed by NHS
OL,13,Fleaders at Cheshire and Merseyside
OL,14,FIntegrated Care Board (ICB) to
OL,15,Ftransform the Maghull Town Hall site
OL,16,Finto a new NHS Neighbourhood Health
OL,17,FCentre.
OL,19,FEsterson said Maghull Town Council had
OL,20,Fbeen considering the future of the town
OL,21,Fhall and adjoining land following the
OL,22,Ffire in February 2025.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
